Subject: [PATCH 128/230] Polish date strip: today marker dot + day-swap
 micro-animation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- DateStrip: add a 4×4px dot under today's chip that stays visible whether
  today is selected or not — dark (bg-base) on the volt-filled selected chip,
  volt-colored on the transparent non-selected chip — so the user always
  knows where they are in the week.
- index.css: add .day-swap keyframe (opacity 0→1 + translateY 4px→0 over
  --t-std/250ms) with a prefers-reduced-motion: reduce → 1ms shortcut.
- Matches.tsx: wrap the match feed (My teams + Other matches groups) in a
  key={selectedKey} className="day-swap" div so React re-mounts the content
  on every day change and the fade-in replays.

Skipped FIX 3 (sliding selection bar): it requires chip position measurement
and translateX animation, which is not a 5-minute change.

